  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Solar Water Heating System (Domestic Sector)&amp;quot; implemented by the Renewable Energy Department, Government of Haryana, aims to promote renewable energy usage and reduce dependence on conventional heating methods by providing financial subsidies to encourage the installation of solar water heating systems in the domestic sector. It also seeks to reduce electricity and fuel bills and promote environmentally sustainable solutions for households.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. Any resident family of Haryana.\n   1. Government employees of Haryana residing in Chandigarh.\n\n<br>\n\n",
